                <div className="p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-3"><Info className="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" /><div><p className="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Scanning Info</p><p className="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Assets must be synced to the Cloud for mobile identification to work.</p></div></div>
