  Activity, Box, QrCode, Trash2, X, Edit2, 
  Info, CheckSquare, Loader2, Check, ChevronDown, Clock, 
  ShieldAlert, Cpu, Wrench, CheckCircle2, Fingerprint, Save, Camera, RotateCcw
